SUMMARY:Silent Bookclub Meeting #70 (Bookstore Crawl and Danu)
DESCRIPTION:Silent Book Club (Toronto)\nThe next event will be a two parte
 r\, bringing back a fan favourite!\n\n1) We will meet at 1pm at Trinity Be
 llwoods to do a "Bookstore Crawl" where we will walk as a group along Quee
 n St W and check out a few different bookstores and see if there are any b
 ooks you'd want to buy *Note that buying a book is not mandatory*.\n\n2) W
 e'll eventually make our way to Danu Social House where we'll have our sta
 ndard Silent Book Club event\, starting at 230Pm!\n*Note you don't have to
  attend the Bookstore Crawl to attend the event at Danu*\n\nMore details a
 bout the stores we'll be visiting will be updated closer to the date!\n\nP
 lease RSVP if you're planning on coming so we can plan appropriately!\n\nT
 o help cover the costs of meetup fees\, we will be taking optional donatio
 ns for this event. If you're inclined to\, feel free to send any amount yo
 u're comfortable with to harresh.s@hotmail.com\, or bring cash to the even
 t. Please note that this is entirely optional and not required to join the
  event! All proceeds will go towards fees for this event and future events
 \, as well as meetup fees.
